    "done_when": "A driver run on the fleet node, using imas_ambix.data.eddb with no new repository module, fetches into JT60SA_ROOT the first-pass channels of E101173 and of the most recent C-series shot EDDB lists: MMSYS cur{CS1..CS4,EF1..EF6}{HiTe,LKAT}, cur1TFLKAT and cur2TFLKAT; PSRC Ip, calIp, magFluxLp1..34 and magPbTC1..23; MDAC curAVVRC1..4; one ssh session per shot. A warm re-read of every fetched channel through VirtualZarrView, with a transport that raises if called, makes no transport call. The evidence fragment docs/evidence/fragments/jt60sa-machine-map/jtmm-eddb-cold-fetch.html records per shot the channel count, total and per-signal wall time, total and per-signal bytes on disk, the EDDB unit strings seen, and every channel EDDB refused with its reason. No EDDB value is committed to the repository.",
